#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:1
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_AreYouCurious"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Are you curious about how your\n"
"POKéDEX is coming along?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:6
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_Cancel"
msgid ""
"Hm? Oh, you haven't caught enough\n"
"POKéMON to make it worthwhile.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:10
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_SoYouveSeenAndCaught"
msgid ""
"Hmhm…\p"
"So, you've seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\n"
"and you've caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:15
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan10"
msgid ""
"Go into grassy areas more and look\n"
"for POKéMON more carefully.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:19
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan20"
msgid ""
"I guess you're getting the hang\n"
"of it. But, it gets harder from here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:23
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan30"
msgid ""
"Some POKéMON only appear in\n"
"certain areas.\l"
"You must be persistent.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:28
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan40"
msgid ""
"Well, it could use more quantity,\n"
"but this is looking more like\l"
"a POKéDEX now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:33
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan50"
msgid ""
"This is coming along pretty good.\n"
"Keep up the effort.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:37
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan60"
msgid ""
"Are you using any RODS?\n"
"There are many POKéMON in the sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:41
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan70"
msgid ""
"Instead of just catching POKéMON,\n"
"how about making them evolve, too?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:45
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan80"
msgid ""
"This is going to be a fantastic\n"
"POKéDEX.\l"
"That's the feeling I'm getting.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:50
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan90"
msgid ""
"You've collected this many…\n"
"Your talent is remarkable!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:54
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan100"
msgid ""
"Have you visited the SAFARI ZONE?\p"
"I hear there are some POKéMON that\n"
"can only be caught there.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:59
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan110"
msgid ""
"You've finally reached\n"
"the 100-kind mark.\p"
"This is an impressive POKéDEX!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:64
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan120"
msgid ""
"There might be POKéMON that can be\n"
"found using ROCK SMASH.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:68
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan130"
msgid ""
"You should get some more POKéMON\n"
"by trading with others.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:72
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan140"
msgid ""
"I've heard of POKéMON that evolve\n"
"when they come to fully love their\l"
"TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:77
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan150"
msgid ""
"I had no idea that there were so\n"
"many POKéMON species in the HOENN\l"
"region.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:82
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan160"
msgid ""
"On occasion, some POKéMON appear\n"
"in large numbers like outbreaks.\p"
"Don't miss opportunities like\n"
"those.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:88
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan170"
msgid ""
"One can get a very good idea about\n"
"the POKéMON of the HOENN region\l"
"by looking through your POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:93
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan180"
msgid ""
"I would say you already qualify as\n"
"a POKéMON PROFESSOR, and a good\l"
"one, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:98
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan190"
msgid ""
"With a POKéDEX this complete,\n"
"you're a real professional at this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:102
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_LessThan200"
msgid ""
"You're very close to completing\n"
"this POKéDEX.\l"
"I can feel it in my bones!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:107
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_DexCompleted"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"Your POKéDEX is complete!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:111
msgctxt "gBirchDexRatingText_OnANationwideBasis"
msgid ""
"Hmhm…\n"
"On a nationwide basis…\p"
"You've seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\n"
"and you've caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:119
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_HowIsPokedexComingAlong"
msgid ""
"OAK: Good to see you!\n"
"How is your POKéDEX coming along?\p"
"Here, let me take a look.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:124
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_SeenXOwnedY"
msgid ""
"The amount of progress you've made\n"
"on your POKéDEX is:\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\p"
"{FONT_NORMAL}PROF. OAK's rating:$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:131
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan10"
msgid ""
"You still have lots to do.\p"
"Go into every patch of grass you\n"
"see and look for POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:136
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan20"
msgid ""
"It looks as if you're getting on\n"
"the right track!\p"
"I've given one of my AIDES a FLASH\n"
"HM. Make sure you go get it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:142
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan30"
msgid ""
"Your POKéDEX could use a bit more\n"
"volume still!\p"
"Try to catch other species of\n"
"POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:148
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan40"
msgid ""
"Good, it's apparent that you're\n"
"trying hard!\p"
"I've given one of my AIDES an\n"
"ITEMFINDER. Be sure to collect it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:154
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan50"
msgid ""
"Your POKéDEX is coming along quite\n"
"well!\p"
"I've given one of my AIDES an\n"
"AMULET COIN. Be sure to get it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:160
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan60"
msgid ""
"Ah, you've finally topped 50\n"
"species!\p"
"I've given one of my AIDES an EXP.\n"
"SHARE. Be sure to go get it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:166
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan70"
msgid ""
"Hoho! This is turning into quite the\n"
"respectable POKéDEX!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:170
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan80"
msgid ""
"Very good!\p"
"I think you'll collect even more\n"
"POKéMON by going fishing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:175
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan90"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! Let me guess… You\n"
"like to collect things, don't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:179
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan100"
msgid ""
"I'm impressed!\n"
"It must have been difficult to do!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:183
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan110"
msgid ""
"You've finally hit 100 species!\n"
"I can't believe how good you are!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:187
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan120"
msgid ""
"You even have the evolved forms\n"
"of POKéMON! Super!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:191
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan130"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Trade with friends to\n"
"get some more!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:195
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan140"
msgid ""
"Outstanding!\n"
"You've become a real pro at this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:199
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LessThan150"
msgid ""
"I have nothing left to say!\n"
"You're the POKéMON PROFESSOR now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:203
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_Complete"
msgid ""
"Your POKéDEX is entirely complete!\n"
"Congratulations!!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:207
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_NationalDexSeenXOwnedY"
msgid ""
"And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:212
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LookForwardToFilledNationalDex"
msgid ""
"I'll be looking forward to seeing\n"
"you fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:216
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_YouveCompletedDex"
msgid ""
"Finally…\p"
"You've finally completed the\n"
"POKéDEX!\p"
"It's magnificent!\n"
"Truly, this is a fantastic feat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:223
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_Wroooaaarrr"
msgid "Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:226
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_ThankYouMadeDreamReality"
msgid ""
"Thank you, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Sincerely, thank you!\l"
"You've made my dream a reality!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/pokedex_rating.inc:231
msgctxt "PokedexRating_Text_LoveSeeingYourPokedex"
msgid ""
"OAK: Ah, welcome!\p"
"Tell me, how is your POKéDEX\n"
"coming along?\p"
"Wahaha!\p"
"Actually, I know how it is, but I\n"
"love seeing it anyway!\p"
"Let's see…$"
msgstr ""
